  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this project, we are raising funds for the abandoned and destitute senior citizens living at Al-Mustafa&apos;s nursing homes: &quot;The Gosha-e-Ameer Hamza RA&quot; (for men) and &quot;Gosha-e-Khatoon-e-Jannat RA&quot; (for women). Your generous donations will help us fulfil their needs such as healthy food, clothing, healthcare facilities etc.</narrative>
